---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
flowchart TD
    Start([vigilo evaluators search])

    Args{CLI arguments valid?}
    Query{Non-empty text query?}

    FilteredSearch[Search namespace with text match]
    NamespaceSearch[Search namespace without text filter]
    Payload[Build data/meta payload]

    Success([Success response])

    ArgsFail([CLI argument error])
    SearchFail([Database or search error])

    Start --> Args

    Args -- No --> ArgsFail
    Args -- Yes --> Query

    Query -- Yes --> FilteredSearch
    Query -- No --> NamespaceSearch

    FilteredSearch --> Payload
    NamespaceSearch --> Payload

    Payload --> Success
    FilteredSearch -. Query fails .-> SearchFail
    NamespaceSearch -. Query fails .-> SearchFail

    class Start command
    class Success success
    class Args,Query,FilteredSearch,NamespaceSearch,Payload system
    class ArgsFail,SearchFail error
